---
import '../styles/shared.css';
import '../styles/pages/about.css';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const meta = {
  title: "About Us | Spokane Stump Grinder",
  description: "Spokane natives serving the Spokane and Coeur d'Alene region since 2023. Straightforward stump grinding and removal, written estimates, and no hidden fees.",
  active: "about.html",
};
---
<Base {...meta}>
<div class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">About Us</p>
    <h1>Spokane locals. Straight answers.</h1>
    <p>Born and raised in Spokane, Jeff brings more than 14 years of hands-on and management experience in home services, including four years as a business owner. The Spokane and Coeur d'Alene region is home, and stump work is what this side of the business does.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="service-request.html">Request an Estimate</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="services.html">See Our Services</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ============ STORY ============ -->
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Our Story</p>
        <h2 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,34px);color:var(--bark)">Built on years of doing the work</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:17px">
          Spokane Stump Grinder might be a newer name, but the experience
          behind it isn't.
        </p>
        <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:17px">
          Jeff grew up in Spokane and has spent most of his working life
          taking care of properties here. He started behind a mower at 13
          and eventually helped build a local property maintenance company
          from one truck into a 30-person operation. After years of managing
          crews, customers, equipment, and everything that comes with a
          growing service business, he wanted to get back to something
          simpler.
        </p>
        <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:17px">
          Stump grinding was a natural fit.
        </p>
        <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:17px">
          It's a specific problem with a clear result. The stump is either
          gone or it isn't. The yard is either treated carefully or it isn't.
          And when the job is finished, the customer should know exactly
          what they paid for and shouldn't be left cleaning up after us.
        </p>
        <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:17px">
          So we built Spokane Stump Grinder around that idea: specialize in
          one thing, invest in the right equipment, communicate clearly, and
          do the work properly.
        </p>
        <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:17px">
          We're local, we know the properties and neighborhoods around
          Spokane and North Idaho, and we're building this business for the
          long haul.
        </p>
        <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:17px">
          No big promises. Just good work, straight answers, and one less
          stump in your yard.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="ph-sq"><img class="photo" src="images/about-stump-profile.jpg" alt="Freshly cut stump with the grinder in the background"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="quote">
      <p>&ldquo;Do good work. Be straight with people. Leave things better than you found them.&rdquo;</p>
      <cite>&mdash; how we've run things from day one</cite>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ PILLARS ============ -->
<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">What We Stand On</p>
    <h2 style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,34px);color:var(--bark)">Three things we don't bend on</h2>
    <div class="pillars">
      <div class="pillar">
        <h3>Transparency</h3>
        <p>No hidden fees and no unknowns going into your project. You get the scope and the price in writing, and that's the number.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <h3>Innovation</h3>
        <p>We keep looking for better ways to do the work &mdash; the right machine for the access, the right technique for the soil we're in.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <h3>Professionalism</h3>
        <p>Uniformed crew, safety and environmental standards followed, and follow-up after the job to make sure the result held up.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ HOW WE WORK ============ -->
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">How We Work</p>
    <h2 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,34px);color:var(--bark)">Look first, then grind</h2>
    <p class="lead">Our approach on every property has always been the same: find the cause, fix it for good. On stump work that means looking at the actual stump before quoting it.</p>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>We diagnose before we quote</h3>
        <p>Diameter at grade, root spread, what's buried nearby, and how the machine gets in. Guessing at those is how a job goes sideways halfway through.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>The plan fits your property and budget</h3>
        <p>Grind it and leave the chips, or haul everything and backfill with topsoil. We'll tell you which one your project actually needs.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>We prevent the return problem</h3>
        <p>Grinding deep enough for what's going in that spot, and backfilling so the ground doesn't sink on you next season.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>We follow up</h3>
        <p>A walkthrough at the end if you're home, and a check-in after to make sure the finished grade settled the way it should.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>We know the seasons here</h3>
        <p>Inland Northwest soil, frost timing, and what a basalt shelf under a stump feels like. Local isn't a marketing word for us.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>We do what we said</h3>
        <p>If something on site genuinely changes the job, we stop and call you. You won't get a surprise invoice at the end.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ TEAM ============ -->
<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Who You'll Deal With</p>
    <h2 style="margin:0 0 28px;font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,34px);color:var(--bark)">The people on your property</h2>

    <div class="bio">
      <div class="ph-sq"><img class="photo" src="images/jeff-james-headshot.png" alt="Jeff James, owner of Spokane Stump Grinder"></div>
      <div>
        <h3>Jeff James</h3>
        <p class="role">Owner</p>
        <p>
          Jeff is a Spokane native and the owner of Spokane Stump Grinder.
          He handles the estimates and oversees the work, so the person you
          talk to is the person accountable for the job.
        </p>
        <p>
          He&rsquo;s spent more than 14 years in the property service
          business and knows what it takes to do good work without making
          things complicated.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ CREDENTIALS ============ -->
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">The Paperwork</p>
    <h2 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,34px);color:var(--bark)">Licensed, bonded, insured</h2>
    <p class="lead">Homeowners ask about this before letting a machine into the backyard, and they should.</p>
    <table class="tbl">
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><strong>Business name</strong></td><td>Spokane Stump Grinder</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>WA contractor license #</strong></td><td>MARKOS*778D8</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>UBI number</strong></td><td>601-939-576</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Serving the area since</strong></td><td>2023</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:16px">Certificate of insurance available on request.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ SERVICE AREA ============ -->
<section class="area" id="service-area" style="scroll-margin-top:90px">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Where We Work</p>
    <h2>Serving the Spokane &amp; Coeur d'Alene region</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom:0">Based in Spokane and covering communities across Eastern Washington and North Idaho. Don't see your town? Give us a call &mdash; if you're near the edge of the map we'll let you know straight.</p>
    <ul class="towns">
      <li><a href="community-airway-heights.html">Airway Heights, WA</a></li>
      <li><a href="community-chattaroy.html">Chattaroy, WA</a></li>
      <li><a href="community-cheney.html">Cheney, WA</a></li>
      <li>Chewelah, WA</li>
      <li>Colbert, WA</li>
      <li>Colville, WA</li>
      <li>Davenport, WA</li>
      <li>Deer Park, WA</li>
      <li>Elk, WA</li>
      <li>Freeman, WA</li>
      <li>Green Bluff, WA</li>
      <li>Hangman Valley, WA</li>
      <li>Hillyard, WA</li>
      <li>Liberty Lake, WA</li>
      <li>Mead, WA</li>
      <li>Medical Lake, WA</li>
      <li>Newport, WA</li>
      <li>Nine Mile Falls, WA</li>
      <li>Otis Orchards, WA</li>
      <li>Spokane Valley, WA</li>
      <li>Veradale, WA</li>
      <li>Coeur d'Alene, ID</li>
      <li>Hayden, ID</li>
      <li>Hayden Lake, ID</li>
      <li>Post Falls, ID</li>
      <li>Priest Lake, ID</li>
      <li>Priest River, ID</li>
      <li>Sandpoint, ID</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ CTA ============ -->
<section class="cta">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Let's take a look at your stump</h2>
    <p>Send photos and details, get a written estimate back. Simple as that.</p>
    <p style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--bark);margin-top:18px">
      Call or text <a href="tel:+15094349554" style="color:var(--moss-dark)">509-434-9554</a>
    </p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="service-request.html">Request Service</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="case-studies.html">See Our Work</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Base>
